<mj-text>
  You already save in the third pillar every month and get 22% income tax back on every
  contribution. The tax benefit covers up to 15% of your gross salary, on at most 6,000
  euros of contributions per year. If your contributions stay below that limit, a higher
  recurring payment also means a bigger tax refund next spring.
</mj-text>
<mj-text><strong>Check whether you could raise your recurring payment:</strong></mj-text>
